{"server":"cn","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_st02","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_st02","title":"一日之祸","storyCode":"WR-ST-2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_st02.txt","sourceHash":"e9a8f702ce140a9ceaab1d17b9f22bb20c11e6ed452178ab1e56a821818dadc0","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"灾难过后的婆山镇哀鸿遍野，尽管炎熔一行帮忙重建城镇，见到此情此景，也难掩失落。另一面，神色古怪的说书人找到黎，黎却反过来，给他说了一段书。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"来这儿！往这儿来点，对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你帮我把那门钉上，拿稳了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有人看见咱家老三，有没有人看见咱家老三呐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你有没有看见咱们家的老三？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，小僧未曾见过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"小余，小余，你在哪儿啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，叔叔给你买糖吃，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔带你看烟花？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......你妈妈要是在，也不会想看到小阿然不吃不喝的，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"......妈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈......妈妈啊啊啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，哭吧，哭出来，总比闷在心里要好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"乌有，这孩子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人......这孩子叫阿然，听说她父亲早早离乡寻工，再也没回来。昨天的事，又不见了母亲，一直恍恍惚惚的，到了今天也不吃不喝呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人！恩人呐，您可别摆出那副脸色，要不是您和克洛丝二位，这镇上，还不得生灵涂炭啊，俗话说得好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，俗话哪管用呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人，我们现在该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"......找到黎和那个说书的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"他们明显知道些什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_pawnshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯......稀客。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你认得我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"婥园之主，煮伞先生，这婆山镇，谁人不知？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"您这位说书先生，继承了那位大商的园子，可不就是婆山镇的老天爷嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"先生请坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"这就要走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"今日先生倒真是沉默......不过，请先留步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"平时都是您给大家说书解闷，只收些象征性的茶水钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"不如今天，让我来给先生说段故事，而且不收茶钱，白送这碗茶水。不知先生意下如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"今天要讲的故事，可比先生搜罗来的那些志怪小说，要简单得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"话说数十年前，大炎东南边陲，有一处名叫婆山镇的镇子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你继续吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"这座婆山镇，平平无奇。镇上不过百来户人家，靠山吃山，日子过得朴实。偶尔会有商队路过，那个日子，就是孩子们狂欢的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"而就是这样一个小镇，却在某一日，遭遇了天灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"天灾没有彻底毁了这座小镇，但活性源石污染了水源。大人们想向附近的城邦求援，但镇上没有信使，离开镇子的大人，又全部杳无音讯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"于是，被迫无奈地，人们抛弃了这座城镇，开始了漫无目的的旅途——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"镇上其实没人知道该去哪里，他们甚至对最近的城市都一无所知，就像听天由命一样，他们选了一个方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"对于那些孩子而言，温暖的床榻，曲折的篱笆，墙上风趣的水渍，突然就全部变成了伸手不见五指的夜晚，还有一条......很长的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"这条路上，饿死了很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"有个孩子，她年岁不大，家境贫寒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"她跟着她的父母走着，看着那些亲密无间的邻里变得少言寡语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"看着那些一起玩耍的哥哥姐姐，为了半块发霉的烧饼，就用尖锐的石子互相殴打。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"她想，也许事情会好起来的。她也努力了，去找浆果，找小动物，去抓河里的鳞兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"她还险些因为抓鳞兽而溺死在河里，也几次因为饥饿而失去意识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"也许只是造化弄人，也许她身边的至亲突然意识到，这个瘦削的小丫头最后的用处，就是为他们省下一些口粮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"当她捧着不知能不能入口的山果回“家”时，那儿已经空无一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"寒夜峭壁间的兽鸣提醒了她，她的生命一文不值。她在恍惚间仿佛天人感应一般，每寸肌肤都在向她描绘死亡的温度，然后——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"她见到了一个人。一个......奇妙的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"那话怎么说来着？哦......欲知后事如何，且听下回分解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"总是在这个时候吊人胃口，真是坏心眼，先生难得像普通人一样尝尝这滋味，感觉如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，掌柜的，小僧找你好久啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"——唔？先生何故在此？方才一场大难，大伙可都在担心你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么......只是在这里走走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"嵯峨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？小僧在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"在画中久矣，点到为止，差不多得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你何苦也费力去捞水中月？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"众人皆醉，你独醒，却还要装醉，反而很不讨喜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嵯峨","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"您不是那说书先生......您就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"说书人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"好自为之罢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"不错的扇子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，这不是克洛丝恩人吗，咋突然闯进来了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，这次大家伙都遭了殃啦，没事，我会和两位恩人一起帮忙重建园子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......乌有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"也许你真的只是一个普通的信使，不过我还是得提醒你一句......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"现在这个情况，如果你仍然要坚持互相保留......我们也只好放弃对你的信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......恩人呐！你在说啥呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"不错的扇子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......您看见了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"炎国功夫多种多样，虽然我不是专家，不过你身手不差......相当不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"想必你隐藏身手肯定是有自己的苦衷吧，这个我不打算刨根问底就是啦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"......但是我并不喜欢明明有能力出手相助，却要给自己找借口畏首畏尾的行为哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"严格说来，这很自私吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，虽然话说得很重，不过你还是有救下阿然的嘛，不用太愧疚啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，恩人。二位救了我，我理当全盘托出才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人原来......早就看穿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"当然啦，只是看你装模作样还挺有趣的而已嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......等从这里逃出去，我会给二位恩人一个交代的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"那说好了喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"恩人......我在想一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想，在这园子里恍然大悟前，我们到底在这座不寻常的镇子上......困了多久？完全没印象......也就是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌有","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"离我们在那灰齐山上推门而入，到底过了多久？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["嵯峨"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["乌有"]}]}
